            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.14.7

- The album art in the full-screen player now follows the pointer evenly across the whole cover. It used to hold at full tilt through a wide band and then lean less as the pointer neared the edge, which made the effect look like it only switched on past the halfway point.
]]></description>
