            <sparkle:version>213</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.14.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.14.6

- Swiping toward the next song no longer opens a blank gap on services that do not publish what is coming next, such as Spotify, Amazon Music and TIDAL. The cover now presses inward instead of sliding aside, and the song still changes on release.
]]></description>
